#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x021b1f
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Hold up all enemy mercenaries<C=R> in the Puerto del Alba area.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Killing, knocking out, or tranquilizing enemies will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Triggering an alert will also result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"  Weapons Assigned: <C=FF4040>Banana<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 7\n"
"* The banana will automatically be equipped when\n"
"   you START MISSION. Other weapons are not\n"
"   allowed.\n"
"* This is a mission. Do not play with your food!"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>在Puerto del Alba地区挟持所有敌方雇佣兵<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>击杀、击晕或麻醉敌人将导致任务立即失败<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>触发警报也将导致任务立即失败<C=R>。\n  分配武器：<C=FF4040>香蕉<C=R>\n  目标数量：7\n* 开始任务时香蕉将自动装备。\n   不允许使用其他武器。\n\n* 这是任务。别拿你的食物玩！"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x021b27
msgid ""
"  Mission Location: Mining Pit\n"
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize the Cocoon Custom<C=R>.\n"
"Destroy the Cocoon or shutdown the onboard AI to complete the mission."
msgstr "任务地点：采掘坑\n<C=FF4040>制伏茧·特装型<C=R>。\n摧毁茧或关闭其搭载的AI即可完成任务。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x031b1f
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Hold up all enemy mercenaries<C=R> in the Underground Passage of the Mine Base.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Killing, knocking out, or tranquilizing enemies will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Triggering an alert will also result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"  Weapons Assigned: <C=FF4040>Banana<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 9\n"
"* The banana will automatically be equipped when\n"
"   you START MISSION. Other weapons are not\n"
"   allowed.\n"
"* This is a mission. Do not play with your food!"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>在矿山基地地下通道挟持所有敌方雇佣兵<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>击杀、击晕或麻醉敌人将导致任务立即失败<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>触发警报也将导致任务立即失败<C=R>。\n  分配武器：<C=FF4040>香蕉<C=R>\n  目标数量：9\n* 开始任务时香蕉将自动装备。\n   不允许使用其他武器。\n\n* 这是任务。别拿你的食物玩！"

