msgstr "SNAKE一行必须制伏合金装备·吉克。\n  摘自“吉克战”"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x15ac9e
msgid "Rescue Chico from the Aldea Los Despiertos Prison Facility and locate the route used by the U.S. mercenaries to transport the nuclear material."
