#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x15aca6
msgid ""
"Proceed immediately to the Control Tower and stop Peace Walker from launching its nukes.\n"
"The WALKMAN cannot be equipped."
msgstr "立即前往管制塔，阻止和平行者发射核弹。\n无法装备WALKMAN。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x15b11e
