#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x75ac9e
msgid ""
"The truck carrying the nuclear warheads was last seen heading toward Volcán Irazú. The bridge North of the prison facility is the only way to get there, and a barricade blocks your path. Destroy it with C4. \n"
"  Weapons Needed: <C=FF4040>C4 Charges<C=R>"
msgstr "载有核弹头的卡车最后被目击正驶向伊拉苏火山。收容设施北面的桥是通往那里的唯一道路，但路障挡住了去路。用C4炸毁它。\n  所需武器：<C=FF4040>C4<C=R>"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x75aca1
