"   player dies."
msgstr "逃离拷问室。\n<C=FF4040>仅限斯内克<C=R>。\n* 在合作模式中，一名玩家死亡后\n   任务即告结束。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x75aca6
msgid "Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base once again. Find him and bring him back."
msgstr "扎多尔诺夫再次从母基地逃跑了。找到他并带回来。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x75aca9
msgid "You guessed it - Zadornov has escaped from Mother Base again. Find him and bring him back."
msgstr "你猜对了——扎多尔诺夫又逃出了母基地。找到他并带回来。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x75acad
msgid "Paz has taken control of Metal Gear ZEKE. Stop her from launching the nuke and get ZEKE back.  "
msgstr "帕兹已控制合金装备·吉克。阻止她发射核弹并夺回吉克。"

