msgstr "关于SBM092"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x7d1b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize all enemy mercenaries<C=R> in the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia. Non-lethal methods such as knocking enemies unconscious or putting them to sleep are acceptable.\n"
"  Time Limit: 16:00\n"
"  # of Targets: 8"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>制伏中埃雷迪亚云雾林内所有敌方佣兵<C=R>。可击晕或使其入睡等非致命手段。\n  时间限制：16:00\n  目标数：8"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x7e1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Retrieve all the items<C=R> from the Miners' Residence. <C=FF4040>Beware of Ghosts<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>No LIFE regeneration items or weapons allowed<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 12:00\n"
"  Time Penalty: 1 min. for triggering an alert\n"
"  # of Targets: 4"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>取得矿工住宅内所有物品<C=R>。<C=FF4040>当心幽灵<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>禁止使用生命值回复道具与武器<C=R>。\n  时间限制：12:00\n  时间惩罚：触发警报罚1分钟\n  目标数：4"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x7e1b1f
msgid ""
"Sneak through the Supply Facility at Puerto del Alba and <C=FF4040>reach the goal without being seen or killing anyone<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Being spotted or killing even a single enemy will result in instant mission failure<C=R>."
msgstr "潜入黎明港补给设施，<C=FF4040>在不被发现、不杀人的情况下抵达终点<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>被发现或杀死哪怕一名敌人都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x7e1b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Shoot all the targets<C=R> at the Back Gate of the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 1:00\n"
"  Time Bonus: +3 to 7 sec. for each target hit\n"
"  # of Targets: 32"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>射击尼加拉瓜美军导弹基地后门的所有目标<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n  时间限制：1:00\n  时间奖励：每命中一个目标+3至7秒\n  目标数：32"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x7f1b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Disarm all claymores<C=R> in the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Triggering a claymore will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 5:00\n"
"  Time Bonus: +10 sec. for each claymore disarmed\n"
"  # of Targets: 8"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>拆除中埃雷迪亚云雾林内所有克莱莫地雷<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>触发地雷会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n  时间限制：5:00\n  时间奖励：每拆除一个地雷+10秒\n  目标数：8"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x7f1b1f
msgid ""
"Sneak through the swamps of Eastern Limón and <C=FF4040>reach the goal without being seen or killing anyone<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Being spotted or killing even a single enemy will result in instant mission failure<C=R>."
msgstr "潜入东利蒙沼泽，<C=FF4040>在不被发现、不杀人的情况下抵达终点<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>被发现或杀死哪怕一名敌人都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x7f1b22
msgid ""
"Pooyan Mission: U.S. Missile Base - Rooftop\n"
"<C=FF4040>Shoot down the Fulton Recovery Balloons to prevent soldiers from being abducted.<C=R>\n"
"<C=FF4040>If 3 soldiers are abducted, you fail the mission.<C=R>\n"
"Earn bonus points by preventing supplies from being stolen.\n"
"  # of Targets: 32"
msgstr "小熊任务：美军导弹基地-屋顶\n<C=FF4040>击落富尔顿回收气球，阻止士兵被掳走。<C=R>\n<C=FF4040>若3名士兵被掳走，任务失败。<C=R>\n阻止补给被窃取可获得奖励分。\n  目标数：32"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x801b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Disarm all claymores<C=R> in the enemy base along Río del Jade.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Triggering a claymore will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 4:00\n"
"  Time Bonus: +10 sec. for each claymore disarmed\n"
"  # of Targets: 8"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>拆除翡翠河沿岸敌军基地内所有克莱莫地雷<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>触发地雷会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n  时间限制：4:00\n  时间奖励：每拆除一个地雷+10秒\n  目标数：8"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x801b1f
msgid ""
"Sneak through the tropical dry forest of Volcán Irazú and <C=FF4040>reach the goal without being seen or killing anyone<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Being spotted or killing even a single enemy will result in instant mission failure<C=R>."
msgstr "潜入伊拉苏火山热带干林，<C=FF4040>在不被发现、不杀人的情况下抵达终点<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>被发现或杀死哪怕一名敌人都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x801b22
msgid "ABOUT SBM115"
msgstr "关于SBM115"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x811b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Retrieve the items<C=R> from the Ruinas de Xochiquetzal, located in the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia.  <C=FF4040>Beware of Ghosts.<C=R>\n"
"<C=FF4040>No LIFE regeneration items allowed.<C=R>\n"
"  Time Limit: 3:00 (30 sec. penalty for triggering an alert)\n"
"  # of Targets: 3"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>取得索奇克察尔遗迹内物品<C=R>，位于中埃雷迪亚云雾林。<C=FF4040>当心幽灵。<C=R>\n<C=FF4040>禁止使用生命值回复道具。<C=R>\n  时间限制：3:00（触发警报罚30秒）\n  目标数：3"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x811b1f
msgid ""
"Sneak through the Cloud Forest of Central Heredia and <C=FF4040>reach the goal without being seen or killing anyone<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Being spotted or killing even a single enemy will result in instant mission failure<C=R>."
msgstr "潜入中埃雷迪亚云雾林，<C=FF4040>在不被发现、不杀人的情况下抵达终点<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>被发现或杀死哪怕一名敌人都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。"

