#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x821b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x831b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x841b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9b1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9c1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9d1b26
#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x9e1b26
msgid ""
"  Mission Location: Bananal Fruta de Oro\n"
"<C=FF4040>Neutralize the enemy chopper<C=R>.\n"
"Destroy the chopper or neutralize the enemy soldiers to complete the mission."
msgstr "任务地点：黄金果香蕉园\n<C=FF4040>制伏敌方直升机<C=R>。\n摧毁直升机或制伏敌方士兵即可完成任务。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x821b1e
msgid ""
"Snake has knocked out a radio soldier in the Supply Facility at Puerto del Alba. <C=FF4040>Use Fulton Recovery to retrieve the radio soldier<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Killing the radio soldier will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>MSF SOLDIERS ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 3:00 (before soldier wakes up)\n"
"  Time Penalty: 30 sec. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr "SNAKE在黎明港补给设施击晕了一名通讯兵。<C=FF4040>用富尔顿回收系统回收通讯兵<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>杀死通讯兵将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>仅MSF士兵<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n  时间限制：3:00（士兵醒来前）\n  时间惩罚：触发警报加30秒\n  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n  目标数：1"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x821b1f
msgid ""
"Sneak through the Mine Base and <C=FF4040>reach the goal without being seen or killing anyone<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Being spotted or killing even a single enemy will result in instant mission failure<C=R>."
msgstr "潜入矿井基地，<C=FF4040>不被发现且不杀任何人抵达目标<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>被发现或杀死哪怕一名敌人都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x821b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Stop the enemy reinforcements<C=R> entering the underpass in the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua.\n"
"<C=FF4040>MSF Soldiers Only<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 20 (Soldiers)"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>阻止敌方增援部队<C=R>进入尼加拉瓜美军导弹基地的地下通道。\n<C=FF4040>仅MSF士兵<C=R>\n  目标数：20（士兵）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x831b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Use Fulton Recovery to retrieve all enemy soldiers<C=R> in the enemy base along Río del Jade.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Killing even one enemy soldier will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"  Time Limit: 6:00\n"
"  Time Penalty: 1 min. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 4"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>用富尔顿回收系统回收翡翠河沿岸敌方基地的所有敌兵<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>杀死哪怕一名敌兵都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n  时间限制：6:00\n  时间惩罚：触发警报加1分钟\n  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n  目标数：4"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x831b1f
msgid ""
"Sneak through the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua and <C=FF4040>reach the goal without being seen or killing anyone<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Being spotted or killing even a single enemy will result in instant mission failure<C=R>."
msgstr "潜入尼加拉瓜美军导弹基地，<C=FF4040>不被发现且不杀任何人抵达目标<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>被发现或杀死哪怕一名敌人都会立即导致任务失败<C=R>。"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x831b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Defend the bases<C=R> at the Heliport of the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua from enemy assault.\n"
"Bases will be captured by the enemy if enemy soldiers remain in the base for a certain period of time.\n"
"Bases change color when captured.\n"
"<C=FF4040>Allowing all bases to be captured will result in instant mission failure<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>MSF SOLDIERS ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"  # of Targets: 15 (number of soldiers)"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>防守基地<C=R>，抵御敌军对尼加拉瓜美军导弹基地直升机场的进攻。\n若敌兵在基地内停留一定时间，基地将被敌军占领。\n基地被占领后会变色。\n<C=FF4040>所有基地被占领将立即导致任务失败<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>仅MSF士兵<C=R>。\n  目标数：15（士兵数量）"

#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0x841b1e
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Use Fulton Recovery to rescue the FSLN POW<C=R> being held beyond the suspension bridge in the Los Cantos area of Irazú.\n"
"  Time Limit: 15:00 (before prisoner is moved)\n"
"  Time Penalty: 1 min. for triggering an alert\n"
"  Items Needed: <C=FF4040>Fulton Recovery System<C=R>\n"
"  # of Targets: 1"
msgstr "<C=FF4040>用富尔顿回收系统营救FSLN战俘<C=R>，他被关押在伊拉苏洛斯坎托斯地区吊桥对面。\n  时间限制：15:00（囚犯被转移前）\n  时间惩罚：触发警报加1分钟\n  所需物品：<C=FF4040>富尔顿回收系统<C=R>\n  目标数：1"

