#: slot/0x00514128/0x215635/0xa01b22
msgid ""
"<C=FF4040>Shoot all targets<C=R> in Mother Base's Kill House <C=FF4040>as quickly as you can<C=R>.\n"
"<C=FF4040>SINGLE PLAYER ONLY<C=R>.\n"
"Support supply markers and support strike markers are not allowed.\n"
"  Time Limit: 5:00\n"
"  # of Targets: 24"
msgstr "在母基地的射击屋<C=FF4040>尽可能快地射中所有目标<C=R>。\n<C=FF4040>仅单人<C=R>。\n不允许使用支援补给标记和支援打击标记。\n  时间限制：5:00\n  目标数：24"
